{"labs": [{"id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le15ob09re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Besides being a sports fan, I also liked animals a lot as a kid. My parents brought me to the Franklin Park Zoo often.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh, yeah, me too. I remember one visit to the zoo distinctly. I was about 8 years old. I was feeding the camel after my Dad and I went on a ride on top.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le15ob09re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You rode on a camel? I never got to do that. I actually asked once if I was permitted to ride on the rhinos. I thought they looked so cool.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh, no. When we went to see the bears, I wanted to feed them too.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You're kidding me!", "id": 2, "time": "19000", "image": "engenn5le15ob09re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: No, really! So, I went to ask one of the zookeepers. I said, \u201cMay I have some fish to feed the bears?\u201d</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What did the zookeeper say?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: He said the bear might ask, \u201cDo you mind if I eat this little girl instead?\u201d", "id": 3, "time": "35000", "image": "engenn5le15ob09re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le15ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le15ob09re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "type": "WLC", "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "I can talk about places and attractions in a city. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can ask and report on things, actions, events or people. ", "type